{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "dedb6d59-1698-87fa-b075-ca9c8b35d5e1",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T11:33:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Patrick Kearney",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:31:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities Department, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:31:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Patrick Kearney, 111 Gidley Street. I got my water bill and it's double what it always is. Doble. Sorry, double. I don't know why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:31:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Let me pull up the account. Is the account under your name, Mr. Kearney?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:31:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it's still in my wife's name. She passed a while back and I never changed it. Is that a problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:32:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not for looking at it. I can see the account for 111 Gidley. The current bill is about twice the usual amount, you're right. Have you had any leaks, a running toilet, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:32:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nothing. I checked. Nada, no drips, nothing running. Same two of us, well, just me now, same as always. It makes no sense. I'm not paying double for water I didn't use."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:32:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Sometimes it's an estimated read or a meter issue, and that can be checked. I can't tell from here which it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:32:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So how do I dispute it? Formally, I mean. In writing, whatever it takes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:32:43-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You'd submit a written request for review to the billing office, with the account name, the service address, and the bill in question. I can note the account now and request a meter re-read, which is a separate step and usually the quickest way to find out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:33:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine, do the re-read. Put it down. You can call me at 401-555-0192."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:33:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0192. I've noted the re-read request and your dispute. Someone will call you back once the meter has been checked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:33:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. And, uh, you're working today, right? Through the holidays too? You people never get a break."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:33:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I was here for some of them, yes. The holidays are behind us now, though. It's an ordinary Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:33:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right, I lost track. Está bien. Thanks. Just fix the bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T11:33:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We'll look into it, Mr. Kearney. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
